# helicoid

- _helicoid(a)_

Answer the parametric equation for the helicoid.

Surface plot of helicoid:

~~~spl svg=A
[-1.0.pi 1.0.pi; -1.0 1.0].surfacePlot(
	helicoid(1.0)
)
~~~

![](Help/Image/helicoid-A.svg)

